  "notes": "{這|は}う means to crawl or creep close to the ground.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {這|は}っている means 'is crawling' (ongoing action)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {這|は}い⟦{回|まわ}る→回る：01150_mawaru⟧: to crawl around\n- ⟦{這|は}い{上|あ}がる→這い上がる：06269_haiagaru⟧: to crawl up\n- ⟦{這|は}い{出|で}る→這い出る：06843_haideru⟧: to crawl out\n- {這|は}いつくばる: to grovel, to lie flat\n\nUSAGE:\n- For babies: ⟦{赤|あか}ちゃん→赤ちゃん：01282_akachan⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{這|は}う\n- For insects: ⟦{虫|むし}→虫：02262_mushi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{這|は}う\n- For plants: ⟦つた→蔦：04968_tsuta⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{這|は}う",
